// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1416003216" "You have defeated Stheno!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3418135361" "Stheno? As in Stheno the Gorgon Stheno, sister of Medusa? Impossible! Surely what you faced was a descendent of the ancient Stheno, not the Snake goddess herself! In any case, you've driven these 'Children of Stheno' underground, at least for now.<br><br>Now you know what happens when someone drinks from the Well of the Furies! It is powerful, yet uncontrolled. If only we can harness this potential. One day, I intend to find out. Then all shall love and fear Arachnos!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P452022568" "What's the deal with {VillainName} hunting those freaky-big mutant Snakes on Mercy Island?"
